{"id":"n35117-1-7","stage":5,"title":"교육열 · 教育热","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35117-1-7-1","ko":"경기가 아무리 어려워도 애들 교육비는 줄일 수 없어요.","zh":"就算经济形势多困难，孩子的教育费用也是不能削减的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기가","audio":"/audio/1735f3414b564c4d1166.mp3"}},{"text":"아무리","meaning":"多么","explanation":"아무리：多么。","readings":[{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71338","senseId":"2","lemma":"아무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무리","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3"}},{"text":"어려워도","meaning":"艰难，贫困","explanation":"어렵다：艰难，贫困；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"4","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려워도","audio":"/audio/ff6880f4a33576d66613.mp3"}},{"text":"애들","meaning":"孩子，小孩","explanation":"애：孩子，小孩；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"애","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73967","senseId":"1","lemma":"애","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애들","audio":"/audio/b4ef5e113942e7f176cd.mp3"}},{"text":"교육비는","meaning":"学费，教育费用","explanation":"교육비：学费，教育费用；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"교육비","audio":"/audio/09ad7ef51ac5626c217b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24053","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교육비는","audio":"/audio/d7cd80debe219e206816.mp3"}},{"text":"줄일","meaning":"减少，缩少，缩减","explanation":"줄이다：减少，缩少，缩减；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"줄이다","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62102","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄일","audio":"/audio/96c888ffcb5fe9c4c2c2.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"经济状况","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"25710","definition":"买卖或交易中表现出的景气与不景气等，与经济领域有关的状况。","pronunciation":["경기"]},{"id":"c434dbfc17cbdbf0","term":"아무리","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/c434dbfc17cbdbf0157a.mp3","entryId":"71338","definition":"虽然如此也。","pronunciation":["아ː무리"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"艰难，贫困","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"因为穷而生活困苦。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"a9fee06ad11f5bbd","term":"애","zh":"孩子，小孩","audio":"/audio/a9fee06ad11f5bbdb2f7.mp3","entryId":"73967","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["애ː"]},{"id":"09ad7ef51ac5626c","term":"교육비","zh":"学费，教育费用","audio":"/audio/09ad7ef51ac5626c217b.mp3","entryId":"24053","definition":"教育方面花的费用。","pronunciation":["교ː육삐"]},{"id":"cd093d6c487c80cf","term":"줄이다","zh":"减少，缩少，缩减","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3","entryId":"62102","definition":"使数或量变得比原来少。","pronunciation":["주리다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다",